---
import MainGridLayout from '../layouts/MainGridLayout.astro';
---

<MainGridLayout title="关于我">
 <div class="card-base max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-10 rounded-[var(--radius-large)]">
    
    <!-- 头部：笔名和一句话简介 -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
     <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-[var(--primary)] tracking-widest drop-shadow-md">
        蓝色大肥鱼
      </h1>
      <p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 tracking-widest text-sm">
        这里是一行简介的占位符
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 正文区：个人介绍 -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-black/80 dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed tracking-wider text-base">

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold border-l-4 border-[var(--primary)] pl-3 text-black/90 dark:text-white/90">
          关于我
        </h2>
        <p>你好，我是夜见。一个喜欢在深夜写东西的人。</p>
        <p>比起复杂的设定，我更在意字里行间的呼吸感。这里存放着我的长篇连载、短篇随想。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold border-l-4 border-[var(--primary)] pl-3 text-black/90 dark:text-white/90">
          小标题
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2">
          <li>长篇：《深海回声》（努力填坑中）</li>
          <li>短篇集：《星屑与玻璃瓶》</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold border-l-4 border-[var(--primary)] pl-3 text-black/90 dark:text-white/90">
          联系我
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <span class="opacity-60">B站：</span>
            <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/297471072" target="_blank" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline">点击这里</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="opacity-60">邮箱：</span>
            <span class="text-blue-500">JmySunrise@outlook.com</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</MainGridLayout>